<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank details April M3 growth.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank details April M3 growth.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data as follows:</p>
<p>(Figures in percent. Six-month annualised rates)</p>
<p>					APRIL  MAY</p>
<p>    Bank loans to non-banks   +8.5   +8.3</p>
<p>    Capital formation	   +4.3   +4.4</p>
<p>The Bundesbank said M3 grew at an annualised rate of 6.4 percent in the six months to April versus 7.9 percent previously.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
